{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三連休始まりましたね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあアイドルはみなさんがお休みの日に\nお仕事をしてることが多いから\nこの三連休に休みは無いんだけど、\nとりあえずラッシュの時間帯に\n電車が空いてるのは嬉しいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は朝から\n『アンフェア the end』観てきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は『バクマン。』観たし\n予告をたくさん観てるから\n次に観たい映画も貯まってくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、結局『ヒロイン失格』観れてないや(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n「サガラとキヨトの乃木坂ぷぷぷ」\n初回です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織の初MC番組の\n記念すべき初回！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏と中田がゲストで出てます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24時30分から\nテレ玉だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、あさって12日に\nテレ玉くんの握手・撮影会があるらしいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTB+見てくれましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/10/4904229/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}